or space;\n\n Parking Space: Guaranteed and secure parking in the city centre.\n\nLocated on the 2nd floor, inserted in a building in the centre of Águeda, with immediate access to commerce, services, public transport and schools.\n\nDon't miss this opportunity to live where everything happens. Schedule your visit now!\n\nWe deal with your Mortgage in a simple, transparent and effective way. We negotiate the best conditions for your case.\n\nEasyGest Finance, your trusted credit intermediary, certified by the Bank of Portugal with the number 0001802.\n\nWe help with the whole process! Contact us or leave us your details and we will get back to you as soon as possible!\n\nEA100118 \n\nEnergy Rating: C",
